= SPPARKS related scripts and tools
:toc:
:date: Oct 7 2025

== Directories

=== crystalline_orientations
See the ./crystalline_orientations/README.adoc


=== stitch
This directory contains scripts useful for processing stitch files.  


=== ipf_color_check
Checks src/ipf_color.h against orix IPFColorKeyTSL (m-3m) reference colours;
build and run lines are at the top of check.cpp.


== Files
* dump2input.py for converting SPPARKS output to input
* copyright: copyright statement placed in every spparks source file
* update_copyright.sh: script used to change copyright
* crystal_to_quat.py: crystal directions ([hkl] build normal + [uvw] scan
  direction) or Bunge Euler angles to the scalar-first quaternion in d1-d4;
  `--as-set N` prints a ready `set` line, `--check q0 qx qy qz` reports the
  directions a quaternion places along +Z/+X, `--selftest` round-trips.
  Needs numpy and scipy.
* material_card.py: lint material parameter cards and fit front velocities
  (docs/MATERIAL_CARDS.md)
* laser_path_convert.py: convert scan paths to the `laser_path file` format
